From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Telesphoreo <me@telesphoreo.me>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:37:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Reject remote privileged packet targets

Editor and tag-query packets must not load or operate on arbitrary remote chunks and entities. Require every privileged target, including 26.2 test blocks, to be loaded and within 32 blocks, and rate-limit abuse logging.

